title: "Freshness-Aware Telemetry for an Observation-Driven Mobile Robot Digital Twin: Research Code"
abstract: >-
  Linux-side Gazebo and ROS 2 research code for freshness-aware mobile-robot
  telemetry, durable delivery, received-state digital-twin projection, and a
  local command center, with selected simulation evidence.
